    "purpose": "LOCKED per-category spec menus for myrobot.shop. Every robot in a category fills this same menu; the renderer shows the fixed rows (\u2014 when blank).",
    "how_to_use": [
      "core[] = must-fill on every robot (never blank).",
      "menu{} = the fixed, ordered spec-sheet rows for the category (grouped by section).",
      "renders: true = buildSpecTable() already emits this category section; false = needs a renderer patch before category rows display; 'partial' = some rows via another section.",
      "ALIAS RULE: when a menu lists payload_kg/speed_ms/run_speed_ms/reach \u2014 also write the alias (payload/speed/run_speed/reach). battery_life, charge_time, flight_time = MINUTES. Include both alias forms.",
      "Only fields that buildSpecTable() renders are listed (per SCHEMA.md). Never include perf/score/img in enrichment batches."
